    "body": "Universal Framelet developer preview for macOS 15+, containing native arm64 and x86_64 Release slices. Internal app version: 0.1.0 / build 1. This is an ad-hoc signed preview, without Developer ID or notarization.\n\nThe ZIP is the unchanged artifact from source `161214ab3d34314ecf9a52a5a2aef79e502a8480`. [Mac CI](https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/framelet/actions/runs/42470246801) passed all 18 build/inspection commands, both slice checks, strict signatures and a fresh ZIP extraction matching bundle bytes, modes and actual attributes. Independent data review verified archive entries and both signed code-page sets. Earlier 30-test evidence retains its debug/ARM64 profile; those tests were not rerun.\n\nDownload the ZIP, its `.zip.sha256` checksum and `Framelet-preview-manifest.json`. [Distribution and installation notes](https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/framelet/blob/main/docs/distribution.md) explain the source-build alternative and trust limits. [Canonical evidence](https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/framelet/blob/main/docs/results/2026/11-08/preview-package-attempt-3.md) preserves both failed attempts and their separate cleanup outcomes.\n\nApp UI, live capture/permissions, camera/audio synchronization, real export playback, a fresh downloaded-app launch and Gatekeeper acceptance remain unverified. No recording/media, account, cloud service, paid enrollment or device access is included in this packaging release.\n"
  },
